{"en": "1428258821", "title": "Enregistrer les indices de l'enquête de terrain vectorielle", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fait partie de : ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Surveillance vectorielle : vue d'ensemble du processus", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1437532161"}}, {"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Guide pratique · Agents de terrain / personnel de laboratoire · Vecteur", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "En bref"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Objectif"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisir les dénombrements des enquêtes larvaires et nymphales et lire les indices entomologiques calculés automatiquement."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Résultat obtenu"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les indices HI, CI, BI, ABJ et PPI calculés et enregistrés avec la demande, avec la vérification de la cible Kemenkes."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Qui s'en charge"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Agents de terrain / personnel de laboratoire. L'accès dépend des droits de l'utilisateur et peut être configuré par votre administrateur."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Avant de commencer"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Vous êtes en train de créer une demande vectorielle et disposez des dénombrements de l'enquête à saisir."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Où"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menu principal → Ordonnance → Ajouter une commande vectorielle → Saisir la demande d’examen, Program = « Vector Field Survey »."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étapes"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dans l'écran de saisie de la demande vectorielle, définissez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Program = « Vector Field Survey »", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : une section « Additional Information — Vector Field Survey » apparaît."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 940, "id": "0c63fa6d-8678-457d-80fa-f419739ba86c", "collection": "contentId-1428258821", "type": "file", "height": 1587}}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sous "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Recensement des larves : Mode C", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Larval Survey — Mode C", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), saisissez le nombre de maisons examinées / positives et de récipients examinés / positifs. L'aperçu calcule automatiquement "}, {"type": "text", "text": "HI", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", "}, {"type": "text", "text": "CI", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", "}, {"type": "text", "text": "BI", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et "}, {"type": "text", "text": "ABJ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (taux d'absence de larves). Lorsque l'ABJ est inférieur à la cible, l'application affiche l'alerte « ABJ below the 95% Kemenkes target. »"}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 958, "id": "65bfdb86-7052-4080-82c1-fbe0f7156c18", "collection": "contentId-1428258821", "type": "file", "height": 410}}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sous "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Enquête sur les pupes : Mode D", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Pupal Survey — Mode D", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), saisissez le nombre de nymphes, la population à risque et une méthode d'enquête : l'indice "}, {"type": "text", "text": "PPI", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " est calculé. Les deux séries d'indices sont indépendantes."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 949, "id": "fbe4846a-0a65-42c0-974b-c96b41bfdf1e", "collection": "contentId-1428258821", "type": "file", "height": 714}}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 4}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ajoutez les lignes d'organismes / d'échantillons et enregistrez pour conserver l'enquête avec la demande."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 941, "id": "78163f2d-273b-456a-866c-cbf6f7bb3886", "collection": "contentId-1428258821", "type": "file", "height": 1245}}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Voir aussi"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisir une demande vectorielle", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1427898389"}}]}]}]}]}], "version": 1}}